{
  "about": "Character Lab: make a MiniMax H3 RefMod from a character's photos. API format; node 10 is copied once per photo (10, 11, ...) and wired to refs_image.ref_image_<n>. Needs ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3Mod; the RefMod is saved to the first registered refmods folder (output/refmods, see README) and fetched from there like a result.",
